1:1 COMMENT "# generic_dissect_fn.z -- compile-time dissection of a generic FREE FUNCTION's"
1:79 EOL "\n"
2:1 COMMENT "# type parameter. `match t` selects a code path by the concrete type at each"
2:77 EOL "\n"
3:1 COMMENT "# monomorphisation; only the matching arm survives in the generated C."
3:71 EOL "\n"
4:1 COMMENT "#"
4:2 EOL "\n"
5:1 COMMENT "# One function per family: a generic declares whether it takes valtypes or"
5:75 EOL "\n"
6:1 COMMENT "# reftypes, so `describe` dissects the former and `describeRef` the latter."
6:76 EOL "\n"
